{
  "_doc": "Section library. Each entry is one manuscript section users can pick. mode: builtin = written by the existing pipeline code; skill = written by the named bioflow_skills skill (placeholder until that skill is registered); author_input = information the system cannot know, left as AUTHOR_INPUT_NEEDED. write_rank decides writing order (lower first); display order is chosen by the user. Skill contract: see SECTION_SKILLS.md.",
  "sections": [
    {"id": "abstract", "title_en": "Abstract", "title_zh": "摘要", "part": "front", "mode": "builtin", "skill": "section-planner", "write_rank": 50, "depends_on": ["results", "discussion"], "needs_citations": false,
     "purpose": "One paragraph: aim, what was done, main results with at most four numbers, main limitation."},
